<!--
  Themed-icon variant for Android 13+, which strips all colour to a single tint.
  The centre cell is therefore omitted rather than recoloured: rendering the same eight-plus-red
  artwork here flattens the red to the tint colour and the mark collapses into a generic 3x3 grid,
  indistinguishable from a calculator or an app drawer. A missing cell survives losing colour and
  still says "one of these is dead".
-->
